    "title": {
      "rendered": "Annual Benefit Report 2021"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1514 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/gln.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"452\" height=\"115\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/gln.png 330w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/gln-300x76.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 452px) 100vw, 452px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 180%;\"><strong>Annual Benefit Report Year 2021</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 160%;\"><em>We are a purpose-driven organization that believes digital and technology companies can and should do more to create a positive impact in society.</em></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3225 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/b-corp-social-media-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"488\" height=\"293\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/b-corp-social-media-2.jpg 850w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/b-corp-social-media-2-300x180.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/b-corp-social-media-2-768x461.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 488px) 100vw, 488px\" /></p>\n<h3><strong>Get Lagos Now </strong>is a results driven, reliable team of experts that takes a 360 approach to your digital success locally and globally since 2010, while staying dedicated to helping make an effective impact on the elevation of local homelessness. 5%+ of all in-cash and in-kind donation of all business profits will continue to be donated to local non-profits yearly. <a href=\"https://getlagosnow.com/e-recycling/\">E-RecylingPDX.com</a></h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-3025\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Mt.-Tabor-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1020\" height=\"765\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Mt.-Tabor-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Mt.-Tabor-300x225.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Mt.-Tabor-768x576.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Mt.-Tabor-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Mt.-Tabor.jpg 2016w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1020px) 100vw, 1020px\" /></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnonewp-image-3446\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block-1024x488.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"761\" height=\"363\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block-1024x488.png 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block-300x143.png 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block-768x366.png 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block-1536x732.png 1536w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block.png 1544w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 761px) 100vw, 761px\" /></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2710 alignleft\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Certified-B-Corp-Logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"230\" height=\"177\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Certified-B-Corp-Logo.png 597w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Certified-B-Corp-Logo-300x232.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 230px) 100vw, 230px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\">B Corp Certified &#8211; We&#8217;re a new kind of business that balances purpose and profit. We make legal, financial, decisions, and actions required to consider the impact Get Lagos Now makes on the decisions of our workers, customers, suppliers, community, and the environment using our business as a force for good.</span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-2687 alignleft\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/benefit-corps-good.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"147\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/benefit-corps-good.png 800w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/benefit-corps-good-300x296.png 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/benefit-corps-good-768x757.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 149px) 100vw, 149px\" /></p>\n<div id=\"wayp-4135\" class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element small-10 columns small-centered prk_9_em wpb_animate_when_almost_visible wpb_verve_fade_waypoint verve_fade_waypoint wpb_start_animation\">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"verve-760\" class=\"wpb_row vc_inner vc_row verve_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"extra_pad prk_inner_block columns small-centered clearfix\">\n<div class=\"vrv_outer_row\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"vc_col-sm-9 columns vc_column_container wpb_column\">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<p class=\"vc_custom_heading\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\"> BCFG Certified &#8211; <span style=\"color: #555555;\">Our aim is to maintain a culture that aligns with the Benefit Corporation philosophy. </span><em style=\"color: #555555;\">Benefit Corporations for Good</em><span style=\"color: #555555;\"> assessed our values and performance to ensure we&#8217;re operating within the standards of a Benefit Corporation. Our authenticity, accountability, messaging and diversity is high. Overall, we are in alignment with the principles and operate with the best interests of our employees, customers, communities and the environment.</span></span><strong style=\"font-size: 23.04px; text-align: center; color: #333333;\"><span class=\"has-inline-color\">                                                        </span></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>In-Kind Donations</strong></h2>\n<h3>In 2021 the <strong>2nd Annual E-Recycling PDX Event</strong> was held on  August 5th at Lexicon Solutions &#8211; More details can be found here  <a href=\"https://getlagosnow.com/e-recycling-2021/\">https://getlagosnow.com/e-recycling-2021/</a></h3>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">We&#8217;re happy to announce that <strong><a style=\"font-size: 20.16px;\" href=\"https://rosehaven.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://rosehaven.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1641970828269000&amp;usg=AOvVaw07V0jr-SSR4FenOtDXW13d\">Rose Haven</a></strong><span style=\"font-size: 20.16px;\"> received 6 refurbished laptops, 6 new desktops, many with new </span><span style=\"font-size: 20.16px;\">cords, one I-phone, and a Samsung tablet to help support their NEW location opening in March 2022!</span></h3>\n<h3><a href=\"https://newavenues.org/\"><strong>New Avenues for Youth</strong></a> will be giving their electronic donations  to youth in current programs that are in need. This year they received a total of 3 laptops and 2 All-In-One desktops.</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #800080;\"><strong><a href=\"https://raphaelhouse.com/\">Raphael House </a></strong><span style=\"color: #282828;\">received 3 newly refurbished laptops. All refurbishing is completed by <a href=\"https://strategicitpro.com/\">Strategic IT</a> &#8211; a Mac and Windows certified IT company in Portland, Oregon.</span></span></h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color\">Cash Donation</span></strong></h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">17% of total company profits were donated to local non-profits</h3>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color\">Volunteerism</span></strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>Volunteer Hours &#8211; </strong>The Get Lagos Now Team had a total of 58 hrs. volunteer hrs. recorded supporting Portland, Oregon non-profits.</h3>\n<h3><strong>Volunteer Driving Miles &#8211; </strong>The Get Lagos Now Team drove a total of 162 miles in volunteer miles in 2021.</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4187 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Bcorp-for-good-2022-2048x1514-1-1024x757.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"671\" height=\"496\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Bcorp-for-good-2022-2048x1514-1-1024x757.png 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Bcorp-for-good-2022-2048x1514-1-300x222.png 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Bcorp-for-good-2022-2048x1514-1-768x568.png 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Bcorp-for-good-2022-2048x1514-1-1536x1136.png 1536w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Bcorp-for-good-2022-2048x1514-1.png 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 671px) 100vw, 671px\" /></p>\n<div id=\"verve-760\" class=\"wpb_row vc_inner vc_row verve_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div></div>\n<div class=\"extra_pad prk_inner_block columns small-centered clearfix\">\n<div class=\"vrv_outer_row\">\n<div class=\"row\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n",
